---

AHQ Store distributes third party apps, thus even though we scan the community repository (that does not include winget, fdroid, appimage[linux] repository), we advise your own discretion.

---

Introducing AHQ Store Service

- It allows you to install AHQ Store Applications for all users bypassing UAC prompt.
- It only works if you're logged into an Administrator account.
- Only the AHQ Store application can trigger this.

BUT, and that's a BIG BUT

- Due to the nature of 3rd party packages, if a malicious package installs, it gains complete system access without UAC prompt.
- Note that the above issue still exists due to the nature of 3rd party packages

This is designed to be insecure & can run arbitrary code.

We recommend not to install this. Only install if you're absolutely sure about it.
